nse from  the west from  uh freedom-loving peoples and from the  united states and the president has just  simply said enough  we're going to find places we can work  together we're going to distrust but  verify  and when we do that and when we do that  well we'll rebalance this relationship  and we hope  convince the chinese communist party to  behave in a way that's fundamentally  different  than the things they have done that have  taken advantage of america for far too  long  that's right and as as we head into this  election season we hope that uh  china and and other adversaries around  the world  don't take advantage of of that as well  you know we hear  we hear a whole lot about election  interference so uh we will uh  continue to hope and of course cheer on  all the all the excellent work that you  have been doing  mr secretary we've taken up enough of  your time i know that uh  you're a very busy man so thank you so  much for taking the time to come on  we will uh we will trust you and we will  distrust and  verify when it comes to china  michael thank you very much for your  time today so long have a wonderful  weekend  thank you very much  [Music]  you

